# Keep text files LF in every working tree, including Windows checkouts with
# core.autocrlf=true: Prettier enforces LF, and the workflow tests match on
# LF-only content. Without this a Windows clone fails `pnpm verify` locally.
* text=auto eol=lf

*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.jpeg binary
*.gif binary
*.webp binary
*.ico binary
*.ttf binary
*.otf binary
*.zip binary
*.jar binary
*.keystore binary
*.jks binary
